1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,670
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,380
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,950
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,330
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,860
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,350
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,200
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,810
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,260
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:42,460
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,460
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:47,920
I can't believe you actually scored 100.

17
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:49,440
You trusted me, Adjutant He,

18
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:50,760
and gave me such an important job.

19
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,480
Of course I couldn't let you down.

20
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,520
But what you did today was too risky.

21
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:58,000
Don't do it again.

22
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:00,720
Don't you dare run.

23
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:02,080
Come back.

24
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,080
What?

25
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,760
You won't let me touch her.

26
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:10,560
Can't I touch someone else?

27
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:11,000
Get inside.

28
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:11,840
I need to talk to you.

29
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,320
Are you okay?

30
00:01:15,820 --> 00:01:18,580
=Episode 6=

31
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:42,480
Here.

32
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:52,880
How could he do this to you?

33
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,000
He's not human.

34
00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:57,200
He's not even a man.

35
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,680
He can't even perform.

36
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,040
He's a monster.

37
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,800
(I'm only warning you
for your own good.)

38
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:04,640
(If you truly knew)

39
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:05,880
(what kind of man he is,)

40
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:09,840
(you'd never entertain that idea again.)

41
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,240
(So...)

42
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,600
(he really was warning me
for my own good.)

43
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:14,680
Ms. Lu.

44
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,560
Can you save me?

45
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,440
You know perfectly well
I'm not really Ms. Lu.

46
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,360
We're the same.

47
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,040
We're not.

48
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,160
They gave up on me.

49
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:31,000
You're carrying out the mission now.

50
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:34,960
So you know what they're after?

51
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,480
They gave up on me

52
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:40,880
before they ever told me.

53
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,600
Meanwhile,

54
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:45,800
Lu Shaoyun took an interest in me.

55
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:47,520
My grandfather needed treatment.

56
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,440
I had no choice.

57
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:51,240
I thought if I stayed with him,

58
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:53,680
it'd be worth it
if he paid Grandpa's medical bills.

59
00:02:54,160 --> 00:02:55,040
How could...

60
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,560
How could I know he'd be a monster?

61
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,960
He enjoys tormenting people.

62
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,800
If this keeps up,

63
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:06,400
sooner or later, they'll kill me.

64
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,120
Ms. Lu.

65
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,120
Please.

66
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,720
Please save me.

67
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:14,000
Give me some time.

68
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,200
I'll arrange something.

69
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:17,080
Until then,

70
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,000
you'll have to hang on.

71
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,400
Don't tip them off.

72
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,600
Okay.

73
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:26,120
(Guanghe Theater)
I heard you've taken in new students.

74
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,720
(1,000 taels)
Use this however you need.

75
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:28,000
This...

76
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:28,920
Tell me if it's not enough.

77
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,640
This... this...

78
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,160
You're very kind, Ms. Lu.

79
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,640
By the way,

80
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:37,200
I found the person you asked about.

81
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:39,200
She's at a small inn by the station.

82
00:03:42,040 --> 00:03:43,600
Here are the tickets you asked for.

83
00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:46,780
(Railway Bureau Special Express
Fancheng-Nancheng, 2nd Class)

84
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,320
Thank you, Troupe Master.

85
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,280
You're welcome.

86
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:13,200
Are you sure you weren't mistaken?

87
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:14,880
Absolutely.

88
00:04:15,040 --> 00:04:17,160
It was identical to the mark
on Ms. Lu's shoulder.

89
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:22,280
Looks like they have more than one pawn.

90
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:33,000
Lili.

91
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:33,600
Here.

92
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:35,600
There's money and a ticket inside.

93
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:37,000
It's enough for
your grandpa's treatment.

94
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,320
The train leaves in two hours.

95
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:39,800
Your grandpa's waiting at the station.

96
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:46,360
Go.

97
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,600
Be careful.

98
00:05:23,780 --> 00:05:26,820
(Railway Bureau Special Express
Fancheng-Nancheng, 2nd Class)

99
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:30,600
Go to the station.

100
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:32,080
Bring her grandfather here too.

101
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:32,840
Yes.

102
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,120
Lady Feng, spare me!

103
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:39,600
Please let my grandfather go.

104
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:41,160
Please!

105
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:48,000
That depends on how well you perform
in front of the governor.

106
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,040
Ms. Lu.

107
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:55,880
You can't keep practicing shooting
like this.

108
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:58,040
You'll ruin your hand.

109
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,760
I know.

110
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:00,680
Thank you, Doctor.

111
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:01,440
I'll be going.

112
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:10,080
Weren't you yesterday's rickshaw driver?

113
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:11,960
What happened to you?

114
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:13,240
It's you,

115
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:13,880
miss.

116
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:16,840
Last night was a disaster.

117
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:19,640
You asked me to take that girl
to the station.

118
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:21,440
We were halfway there

119
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:23,440
when two men and a woman ambushed us.

120
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,240
They dragged the girl away.

121
00:06:25,440 --> 00:06:27,040
And this is what they did to me.

122
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:31,160
Do you remember what they looked like?

123
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:34,840
I didn't know the men,

124
00:06:35,280 --> 00:06:37,360
but I'd given that woman a ride before.

125
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:38,880
I think she was

126
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:41,760
a maid to one of the concubines
at your residence.

127
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:45,120
(Are you looking to buy it?)

128
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,280
(Yanyan.)

129
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:48,000
(Give me a son,)

130
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:50,040
(and I'll make you my principal wife.)

131
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:53,200
(Looks like there are more of us
in this together than I thought.)

132
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:54,560
(They gave up on me.)

133
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,080
(You're carrying out the mission now.)

134
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,920
(If Feng Yanyan is one of them too,)

135
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,960
(why is she so determined to expose me?)

136
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:03,960
(Whatever the reason,)

137
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,840
(she's trying to expose my identity.)

138
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:07,600
(I can simply tell He Jingchen)

139
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:08,960
(and let him handle her.)

140
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:10,600
Miss.

141
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:11,800
Miss.

142
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:15,520
Here.

143
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:17,000
For your medical bills.

144
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:17,760
Take care.

145
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:18,960
Thank you, miss.

146
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:19,880
Thank you, miss.

147
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:26,280
Why didn't you do as I said that day?

148
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:30,080
I told you I needed a child.

149
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,680
But you don't have one.

150
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,160
Then give me one.

151
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:37,880
I knew it all along.

152
00:07:38,280 --> 00:07:40,360
You're determined to
establish her as Lu Zhentian's daughter.

153
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:42,040
If she really is his daughter,

154
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:43,680
marry her and you'll be
the Lu family's true son-in-law.

155
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:48,160
You'd have a more legitimate claim
than Lu Shaoyun, the fake son.

156
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,400
A claim to what?

157
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:50,800
The Lu family's chamber of commerce.

158
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,320
Control of the Lu Army.

159
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:53,360
Don't deny it.

160
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:02,560
(Soon everyone will know)

161
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,200
(there's no real Ms. Lu.)

162
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,800
(I won't let you marry
into the Lu family.)

163
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,720
(Feng Yanyan is out to get me.)

164
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:10,320
(He Jingchen can't seem to bring himself
to be ruthless with her.)

165
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:12,720
(But a fake is still a fake.)

166
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,960
(If I'm bound to be exposed someday,)

167
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:16,400
(instead of worrying every day,)

168
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,800
(I should turn the tables.)

169
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:20,960
(If Lu Zhentian learns
I'm not really his daughter)

170
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,320
(and still accepts me,)

171
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:24,880
(then the photo He Jingchen has)

172
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,280
(will become worthless.)

173
00:08:26,960 --> 00:08:28,600
(I won't have to be so wary of him.)

174
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:31,800
Looks like

175
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:34,000
I should thank Lady Feng

176
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,520
for handing me this opportunity.

177
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:43,360
Yutang, you're here.

178
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,000
Father.

179
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:57,000
Father, get some rest.

180
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:58,760
Let me tell you a story.

181
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:02,880
What story?

182
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:06,120
Father, remember the painting

183
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:07,960
Lady Feng gave you on your birthday?

184
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,040
I do.

185
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:10,800
The one with two monkeys and the Buddha.

186
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:13,720
Actually,

187
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:16,000
there's another version of that story.

188
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:22,560
Legend says the Buddha knew
the Six-Eared Macaque was an impostor,

189
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:24,000
but chose not to expose him.

190
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:27,800
Instead, he let him keep protecting
Tang Sanzang on his journey west.

191
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:35,240
Move.

192
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:38,800
Let go of me!

193
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:51,360
Rickshaw!

194
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:54,640
Where to?

195
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:55,240
Governor's Residence.

196
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:56,120
Right away.

197
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:04,200
Lady Feng.

198
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,080
They're here.

199
00:10:09,760 --> 00:10:10,240
Governor.

200
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,880
Lady Feng wants you
in the front courtyard.

201
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:17,680
Please see Lu Shaoyun for who he is

202
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,520
and avenge your own daughter.

203
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:22,800
I'll get to the bottom of this.

204
00:10:47,990 --> 00:10:52,320
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

205
00:10:53,980 --> 00:10:57,320
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

206
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:59,940
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

207
00:11:01,460 --> 00:11:03,020
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

208
00:11:03,020 --> 00:11:07,140
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

209
00:11:07,700 --> 00:11:13,100
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

210
00:11:14,700 --> 00:11:18,020
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

211
00:11:18,020 --> 00:11:21,380
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

212
00:11:21,380 --> 00:11:23,940
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

213
00:11:23,940 --> 00:11:26,940
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

214
00:11:27,220 --> 00:11:33,460
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

215
00:11:33,940 --> 00:11:37,260
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

216
00:11:37,260 --> 00:11:40,500
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

217
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:47,260
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

218
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:50,540
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

219
00:11:50,540 --> 00:11:53,980
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

220
00:11:53,980 --> 00:11:56,100
♪Boundless♪
